      "question_id": "impl-chunk-id",
      "answer": "make_chunk_id in src/copilot/models/chunk.py builds a canonical JSON list holding the repository name, the file path, the SHA-256 of the source text, the chunking strategy name and version, its parameters and the chunk's position (a line range, or a line number plus a fragment index). It hashes that text with SHA-256 and keeps the first 16 hexadecimal characters. Because every one of those inputs is part of the hash, the id is deterministic, and editing a file's content changes all the chunk ids of that file.",
